0..77 Comment "//! A seat\'s protocol evolved: session subtyping as a flow and equi-recursive"
78..151 Comment "//! unfolding as a path [Gay-2005-subtyping_session_types_pi_calculus]. A"
152..231 Comment "//! protocol that adds a choice the seat may take is a supertype, so a recorded"
232..310 Comment "//! run of the old protocol rides forward to the new one; a run that takes the"
311..347 Comment "//! new choice is no run of the old."
348..351 Comment "//!"
352..411 Comment "//! - cites: [Gay-2005-subtyping_session_types_pi_calculus]"
412..415 Comment "//!"
